ing worlds with each playthrough. As you explore the multiverse, you'll face increasingly difficult challenges that test your strategy and perseverance. No two runs are the same in this roguelike adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/f8c8703db9b56fcd1d37f6a6b895f4f7.poster.avif?t=1753992804\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/f8c8703db9b56fcd1d37f6a6b895f4f7.webm?t=1753992804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/f8c8703db9b56fcd1d37f6a6b895f4f7.mp4?t=1753992804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/b124fd7bc787b63383d277d5f9799425.webp?t=1753992804\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across different dimensions, each with its own unique set of rules, environments, and enemies. From futuristic landscapes to ancient ruins, the multiverse is vast and full of surprises waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/2548f65d22ed580a3aff7daefc7c54f6.poster.avif?t=1753992804\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/2548f65d22ed580a3aff7daefc7c54f6.webm?t=1753992804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/2548f65d22ed580a3aff7daefc7c54f6.mp4?t=1753992804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The multiverse is in chaos! Capy\u2019s mission? Fix the fractured timelines and restore balance to the universe. It\u2019s up to you, Capy, to save the multiverse and become the ultimate capybara hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all our hearts, we've crafted this game in the hopes that players will find joy and excitement in every corner of our expansive multiverses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We made this game for you, hoping it'll give you some laughs, some edge-of-your-seat moments, and a bunch of good times with friends. Can't wait for you to play it and make it your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to help Capy save the Multiverse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/45d40075597b564c87561fe3f127e0fa.avif?t=1753992804\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0d\ud83e\udd0d\ud83e\udd0d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880270/extras/f87a268076494906f17aba3483fd7706.avif?t=1753992804\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
